flashference patch 1/2: trimmed draft head for Qwen3.5 native MTP (draft-mtp)
Base: ggml-org/llama.cpp tag b11884 (commit 63412d873). Apply first.
  git clone --branch b11884 --depth 1 https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp.git
  cd llama.cpp; git apply /path/to/flashference/patches/b4-trim-draft-head.patch
Behaviour is off unless the env vars LLAMA_MTP_TRIM_FILE (token-rank file) and LLAMA_MTP_TRIM_K are set.
